{"title":"Ashsworn Pyromancer","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 59 Ashsworn that attacks with burn (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>56</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>31</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>240</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>56</td><td>in the wilds around 298, -1111</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=60\" title=\"Pick level 60\"><td><b>60</b></td><td>455</td><td>37.5</td><td>3,000</td><td class=\"muted\">1,365 · 52.5 · 9,000</td><td>31</td><td>in the wilds around 281, -1114</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer?lv=61\" title=\"Pick level 61\"><td><b>61</b></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td>240</td><td>in the wilds around 291, -1184</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 4 recorded drops, 285 total, 56–80 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×56–80</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Molten Heart</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 10</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6304\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1997.8px,619.8px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/6/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1536px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/7/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/8/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2048px;top:-512px\"><i style=\"left:1856.3px;top:-619.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1879.7px;top:-613.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1867.4px;top:-605.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:2061.2px;top:-650.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1949.8px;top:-560.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:2028.2px;top:-610.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1936.1px;top:-561.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1931.9px;top:-550.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:2022.2px;top:-604.5px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 275, -1178 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 284, -1113 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 224, -1126 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"ashsworn-pyromancer\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Ashsworn: <a href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-acolyte\">Ashsworn Acolyte</a> <span class=\"muted\">(57)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper\">Ashsworn Flamekeeper</a> <span class=\"muted\">(60)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/keeper-hallgrim\">Keeper Hallgrim</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ash-prophet\">Ash Prophet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(63)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/0bb49ad7ee7c334fc732.svg\" alt=\"Ashsworn Pyromancer\"></div><h3>Ashsworn Pyromancer</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>59 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 59–61)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Ashsworn</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>burn · ranged</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>440</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>37</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2950</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>4.5</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cap